hmod/main.go, action: create, note: chmod binary with core mode parsing and file mode application\"\n   - Requirements: R1 (srd089 R1.1 invocation/arg parsing), R2 (srd089 R1.2 octal), R3 (srd089 R1.3 symbolic), R4 (srd089 R1.4 --help/--version)\n   - Acceptance criteria: AC1 (go build succeeds), AC2 (go vet passes), AC3 (octal mode works), AC4 (symbolic mode works)\n   \n   After writing the file, run `go build -o bin/chmod ./cmd/chmod/` and `go vet ./cmd/chmod/...` to verify.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/pdiddy/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-dl-cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn-T-go-unix-utils-worktrees-5547/ebf70cd2-4472-4509-9c54-ca72351c11e3.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ebf70cd2-4472-4509-9c54-ca72351c11e3","uuid":"c22144c1-b51c-4801-b9ba-c241f172e031","timestamp":"2026-05-23T17:03:49.299Z","isSynthetic":true}
